   "price": "7.99",
   "available": true,
   "descriptionHtml": "<p>From the Food Labs at Naagin, we bring you an all new Instant Taste Upgrade - this time in the form of a Crispy Chilli Oil. You asked for something not too spicy and healthy for everyone and we're here to tell you, we got you covered (pun intended)!</p><p>Naagin Crispy Chilli Oil brings out the best of almost any pairing you can think of. Built on a base of global favourite Guntur chillies, our newest cooking base, kitchen and dining table must-have is a special blend of crispy-crunchy, slow-roasted flavours and a solid dose of umami you can savour. While most chilli oils are just infusions, we bring you a crispy classic which is 100% Vegan, no added sugars and no transfat.</p><p>Ethically sourced and locally made using the day's freshest vegetables, our Crispy Chilli Oil has original flavours born from our obsessive passion to create unique products that our customers will love.</p><p>Heat Level - Mildly Spicy (2/10)</p><p>SHU Rating - 1,000-2,000</p>",
