   "descriptionHtml": "<p>Inspiration: Karak Sohan Halwa \u2014 a Lucknowi confection, paper-thin in one shop in Lucknow, brought back by the Chief Mithaiwala from a Lucknow trip. The brief was odd on purpose: make an inside-out chikki. The first attempt sandwiched sohan halwa between two coats of chocolate \u2014 the jaggery caramel of sohan halwa already echoes a chikki. Sea salt came in at tasting. A day-one BSS product. Not a recreation. A structural translation of its snap, pull, and caramel density into a bark.</p>",
