   "price": "6.99",
   "available": true,
   "descriptionHtml": "<p>Kai Murukku, literally translating to \"hand-rolled,\" embodies the essence of traditional South Indian cooking. The dough for this South Indian chakli is kneaded for a long time, once stiff enough, it is piped into spiral patterns.</p><p>Rice flour provides for a nice texture, while urad dal flour adds a touch of earthiness. Cumin seeds and butter have a warm depth of flavour, and a sprinkle of salt ties everything together, creating irresistible, savoury notes.</p><p>Sweet Karam Coffee's Kai Murukku is more than just a snack; it's a journey into the heart of South Indian culinary heritage. Order these flavourful snacks from our website now!</p>",
